CORE no-new-smt
nondet.i
--arch x86_64 --os linux
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
Range constraints on non-deterministic x86 80-bit extended long double values
exclude unnormals, which are NaN.
The new SMT2 back end (--incremental-smt2-solver) runs out of memory on this
test.
